00:38:06,605 --> 00:38:07,045
[SPEAKER_06]: Impossible.

426
00:38:11,228 --> 00:38:14,311
[SPEAKER_06]: But can you do them if you completely don't pay any attention to that theme?

427
00:38:15,351 --> 00:38:16,232
[SPEAKER_06]: Equally impossible.

428
00:38:16,993 --> 00:38:18,654
[SPEAKER_06]: So that's the middle ground I'm talking about.

429
00:38:21,118 --> 00:38:38,810
[SPEAKER_06]: And factually, back on to the layperson who only keeps the five precepts, but recollects the dhamma, themes of the dhamma, the value of the virtue, all of those, and constantly is sort of feeding and sustaining those evaluations and re-evaluations in their mind.

