432
00:39:02,688 --> 00:39:05,509
[SPEAKER_06]: And back on to the original example when we started.

433
00:39:06,389 --> 00:39:08,530
[SPEAKER_06]: Imagine you're in a perpetually good mood.

434
00:39:09,851 --> 00:39:20,295
