435
00:39:21,494 --> 00:39:21,734
[SPEAKER_06]: Why?

436
00:39:21,834 --> 00:39:31,284
[SPEAKER_06]: Because you have cultivated it, you have sustained it, you have protected it, and you have invested active effort in thinking, pondering, evaluating, re-evaluating about those things.

437
00:39:34,247 --> 00:39:38,491
[SPEAKER_06]: So, in other words, you won't lose the context even when things are not good.

438
00:39:39,092 --> 00:39:45,018
