00:44:42,835 --> 00:44:58,098
[SPEAKER_06]: The vast majority has genuine intention in practice, but as I said, there's been so much since the suttas, since the Buddha's passing away, that today's work is actually on the level of uncovering most of the stuff that's been covered with wrong instructions and wrong ideas.

