00:45:25,548 --> 00:45:34,372
[SPEAKER_06]: So, I get disturbed when I have an oversight, basically, when I slip, when I forget about what I was supposed to look.

507
00:45:35,387 --> 00:45:36,788
[SPEAKER_06]: But that's not what the suttas say.

508
00:45:37,528 --> 00:45:40,910
[SPEAKER_06]: You get disturbed when there is greed, aversion, delusion.

509
00:45:41,711 --> 00:45:47,754
[SPEAKER_06]: Are greed, aversion, delusion on the level of objects of your senses and concentrations and sensations?

510
00:45:47,934 --> 00:45:48,094
[SPEAKER_06]: No.

511
00:45:48,634 --> 00:45:56,299
[SPEAKER_06]: They're on the level of your intention, on the level of your state of mind, on the level of your desires and themes and preconceived notions.

512
00:45:57,359 --> 00:46:01,242
[SPEAKER_06]: So, that's where you need to uproot them.

513
00:46:01,262 --> 00:46:03,563
