514
00:46:04,337 --> 00:46:04,877
[SPEAKER_06]: Yeah.

515
00:46:05,257 --> 00:46:06,658
[SPEAKER_06]: Indirectly, directly, the mind.

516
00:46:06,738 --> 00:46:09,718
[SPEAKER_06]: Yeah, exactly, yeah.

517
00:46:09,758 --> 00:46:16,060
