518
00:46:16,100 --> 00:46:21,781
[SPEAKER_05]: And that's why one has to recognize, as you said, signs of the mind and the moods.

519
00:46:22,181 --> 00:46:22,361
[SPEAKER_05]: Yeah.

520
00:46:22,501 --> 00:46:24,041
[SPEAKER_05]: And the patterns of thought.

521
00:46:24,201 --> 00:46:31,663
[SPEAKER_06]: Recognizing the signs of the mind, it's basically this recognizing that the mind is not something that can be an object of your attention.

522
00:46:32,422 --> 00:46:38,129
[SPEAKER_06]: It doesn't matter how hard you focus to the milliseconds of your experience, mind is not there.

523
00:46:38,669 --> 00:46:39,811
[SPEAKER_06]: It's in the opposite direction.

524
00:46:40,532 --> 00:46:51,224
[SPEAKER_06]: And then, recognizing that the way to deal with the mind, with such mind, with the mind of such nature, that cannot be directly accessed or attended,

525
